{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1544072-modern-exalted-artifact-ideas","id":1544072,"title":"Modern Exalted Artifact ideas","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-10-16T21:44:08-07:00","id":1544072,"title":"Modern Exalted Artifact ideas","content":"As it says. I'm looking for ideas for an artifact to be used by a character in a modern-day Exalted setting. The character is Night Caste, but with most Favoured Abilities being Twilight Caste, or Twilight Caste with many Night Caste abilities favoured. Either way, the artifact takes the form of a flat black bodystocking. Currently, I'm thinking of a bonus to Stealth and Athletics and extending the duration of Spider Foot Style to minutes, and its first Evocation toughens it to the point of acting as light artifact armour. A second Evocation allows it to be shifted into any sort of conventional clothing. The first Evocation on the other side of its tree allows relatively small objects to be stored Elsewhere (if the wearer would not find the object cumbersome to carry and use, it's small enough). I have no idea what the second Evocation on that side should be, or the capstone Evocation.<br /> <br /> What would seem a suitable rating? Is it too much of a grab bag? It's intended to be paired with a mask with sensory and disguise abilities, if that matters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-19T09:53:42-07:00","id":1544297,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LadyLens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1544072-modern-exalted-artifact-ideas#post1544072\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Either way, the artifact takes the form of a flat black bodystocking. Currently, I'm thinking of a bonus to Stealth and Athletics and extending the duration of Spider Foot Style to minutes, and its first Evocation toughens it to the point of acting as light artifact armour.</div> </div> </div> </div>Since Silken Armour already exists in the system, I feel as though it should either be that by default, or else drop the stat boost as part of a premise of incentivizing the use of stealth. I think an Evocation to make something that isn't armour act like armour is a bit unwieldy.<br /> <br /> Silken Armour is said to be Artifact 4 by default, but I think one could reasonably drop it to three dots (which I think would be in line with the other powers you propose) in exchange for removing its compatibility with Martial Arts.<br /> <br /> I'll think about some of the other questions.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}